---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import CaptureForm from "../components/forms/capture-form.astro";
import { ArrowRight, BookOpen, Wrench, Store } from "@lucide/astro";
---

<Layout title="Battery Digital Passport Hub">
  <div class="relative bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 lg:py-32">
      <div class="lg:w-2/3">
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-6">
          The technical guide to the <span class="text-blue-600">EU Battery Digital Passport</span>.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 mb-8 max-w-2xl">
          Compliance doesn't wait for 2027. Understand the data model, compare vendors, and build your roadmap to track 90+ mandatory data points across a global supply chain.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg p-6 max-w-xl">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-slate-900 mb-2">Download the 2027 Readiness Checklist</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">Get the step-by-step breakdown of requirements for economic operators.</p>
          <CaptureForm form="checklist" submitLabel="Send me the checklist" class="btn btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto mt-2 sm:mt-0 sm:ml-2">
            <label class="sr-only" for="email">Work Email</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required placeholder="name@company.com" class="w-full sm:w-64 px-4 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-md focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:border-blue-500 bg-white" />
          </CaptureForm>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <a href="/library/" class="group block p-6 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <BookOpen class="w-8 h-8 text-blue-600 mb-4" />
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Technical Library</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">Exhaustive guides on the data model, access rights, and carbon footprint methodology.</p>
        <span class="text-blue-600 font-medium inline-flex items-center">Read the guides <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4 ml-1" /></span>
      </a>

      <a href="/tools/" class="group block p-6 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <Wrench class="w-8 h-8 text-blue-600 mb-4" />
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Interactive Wrenchs</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">Check your compliance gaps, calculate timelines, and estimate carbon footprints.</p>
        <span class="text-blue-600 font-medium inline-flex items-center">Use the tools <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4 ml-1" /></span>
      </a>

      <a href="/vendors/" class="group block p-6 bg-white border border-slate-200 rounded-lg hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
        <Store class="w-8 h-8 text-blue-600 mb-4" />
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-blue-600 transition-colors">Vendor Directory</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mb-4">Compare software platforms built for the EU Battery Regulation mandate.</p>
        <span class="text-blue-600 font-medium inline-flex items-center">Compare vendors <ArrowRight class="w-4 h-4 ml-1" /></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-4">Timeline to 2027</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">The delegated act drops technical specifications soon, but data collection must start earlier.</p>

      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center items-center gap-4">
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 w-full md:w-64 text-left">
          <div class="text-blue-600 font-semibold mb-1">Feb 2024</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-slate-600">Regulation enters into force. Carbon footprint declaration rules begin.</div>
        </div>
        <ArrowRight class="hidden md:block w-6 h-6 text-slate-400" />
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 w-full md:w-64 text-left">
          <div class="text-blue-600 font-semibold mb-1">Mid 2025</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-slate-600">Expected adoption of Delegated Act for Passport technical specifications.</div>
        </div>
        <ArrowRight class="hidden md:block w-6 h-6 text-slate-400" />
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 w-full md:w-64 text-left border-blue-500 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-2 h-full bg-blue-600"></div>
          <div class="text-blue-600 font-semibold mb-1">Feb 18, 2027</div>
          <div class="text-sm text-slate-600">Digital Battery Passport mandate becomes legally binding for EV/LMT batteries.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10">
        <a href="/tools/timeline-calculator/" class="btn btn-secondary">Calculate your specific deadline</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
